# GL functions the loader's renderer calls, proxied to the native GL helper (shim/docs/gl-helper.md).
# One per line: Name [custom] -- prototypes come from the SDK's OpenGL gl3.h; a function gl3.h lacks gives its own
# prototype after the name. custom = encoder/decoder written by hand in glproxy.c / glhelper.c (pointers, results,
# outputs, uploads); everything else is generated by shim/tools/gen_glproxy.py.

